    "description": "<p>There is an art to getting unapproved merchandise into and out of high security habitats, and you are a virtuoso. Even inner system habs hold restrictive views on unfettered capitalism. You don’t consider yourself a criminal so much as a subtle expediter of market forces, an angel of supply come to make a bargain with the devil of demand.</p><p><strong>Suggested Motivations:</strong> +Personal Career, +Survival, +Wealth, –Authority</p><p><strong>5 PP:</strong> +1 Moxie · +5 INT, +50 Rep (Your Choice) · Academics: (Choose One) 30, Deception 40, Fray 30, Interest: Black Markets 40, Interest: (Choose One) 30, Kinesics 25, Networking: (Choose Two) 40, Perception 30, Persuasion 50, Profession: (Smuggling) 50, Protocol 25</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Transhuman, p. 35.</em></p>",
